# Density Compare
# Yttrium (Y) — real density 4.472 g/cm³. equal masses: Yttrium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Yttrium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 12.1mm color: #94ffff at (-20mm, 6.1mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 35.7 g — the water cube is the reference
